        "original_id": "00ae61b2-1c37-51bb-a892-8884819e7fd3",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Fade to Black, Flashback, The Way\n- Companies: Delphine Software International, Delphine Software, Electronic Arts, U.S. Gold, Sunsoft, Puzzling Dream, PlayWay\n- Concepts: action-adventure games, science fiction cinematic platform games, 2D puzzle platformer games, game inspirations\n\nFacts:\n- Flashback was released in 1992 as a science fiction cinematic platform game.\n- Flashback was released in the United States as Flashback: The Quest for Identity.\n- Delphine Software of France developed Flashback.\n- U.S. Gold published Flashback in the United States and Europe.\n- Sunsoft published Flashback in Japan.\n- Delphine Software International developed Fade to Black as an action-adventure game.\n- Electronic Arts published Fade to Black.\n- Puzzling Dream made The Way as a 2D puzzle platformer game.\n- PlayWay published The Way.\n- The Way was inspired by Another World, Heart of Darkness, and Flashback.",
